const FEATS=[
  {name:'Always Prepared',book:'core',trigger:'Quick Action',desc:'You always have an ace up your sleeve. [Quick Action] Take out or retrieve a useful item, a piece of information, or a small, easy-to-hide weapon.'},
  {name:'Archer',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re a modern-day Robin Hood; your arrows never miss. Gain a Free Re-roll when using, repairing, evaluating, or handling a bow.'},
  {name:'Artist',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'Popular or misunderstood, you’re still an artist. The world is your stage. Choose an art-form (dancing, singing, painting, etc.). Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls regarding your chosen art-form.'},
  {name:'Bodybuilder',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re big, strong, and muscular. How much can you bench? Gain a Free Re-roll when lifting, carrying, or breaking something.'},
  {name:'Car Jump',book:'core',trigger:'Full Turn',desc:'You speed up an improvised ramp and make your ride jump in the air. Everyone holds their breath. [Full Turn] While driving, have your ride jump over something to automatically pass an obstacle or barrier, or to gain +2 Speed during a Chase. Upon landing, the ride loses 1 Armor. Usable with rides that travel on land or water, but not with flying Rides.'},
  {name:'Cash Flow',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re from old money, or simply have quite a lot of cash on hand. Either way, money is no problem! Start the game with 3 Cash, and gain 1 Cash at the beginning of each Session — unless you’re imprisoned or lost in the middle of nowhere.',creationEffects:{cashOverride:3}},
  {name:'Combo',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',adr:true,desc:'After each strike, there is always another, faster than the first. One-two! Come on! After hitting an Enemy, spend 1 Adrenaline to deal 1 additional Grit. You can spend several Adrenaline to continue the combo and deal additional damage.'},
  {name:'Counter',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'The best defense is always a good offense. React against an Enemy by rolling Brawn+Fight instead of the requested Skill. You ignore all -1s from Conditions and circumstances.'},
  {name:'Crazy Stunt',book:'core',trigger:'Full Turn',desc:'You’re the reason why they invented those “Don’t try this at home” disclaimers. [Full Turn] While driving, make an absolutely crazy maneuver to win the chase. Destroy your ride and flip a coin — Heads: the Director fills in 1 Need box; Tails: the Director fills in 5 Need boxes. If, after this maneuver, all Need boxes are full, you’ve won the chase.'},
  {name:'Detective',book:'core',books:['core','osh'],trigger:'Passive',desc:'The crime-scene speaks to you. Where others see chaos, you know how to spot a clue. Gain a Free Re-roll when looking for clues, following trails, or searching a room.'},
  {name:'Flying Kick',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'No enemy is out of reach for your deadly kicks. Attack an Enemy within Close or Medium Range with +1 to the roll. Additionally, you can always attack an Enemy within Close Range bare-handed, and you don’t need to spend Adrenaline to do so.'},
  {name:'Full Throttle!',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re a speed junkie who lives life in the fast lane. When behind the wheel of a ride, ignore penalties from the Nervous Condition and from Top Speed. Once per chase, when you reach Top Speed, gain 1 Adrenaline.'},
  {name:'Get Down!',book:'core',trigger:'Full Turn',desc:'You grab your friend and drag them away from danger one second before disaster. [Full Turn] You and another Hero quickly hide, dodge a hail of bullets, or avoid being run over — without needing to roll the dice.'},
  {name:'Gunslinger',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'The gun is an extension of your arm. Every shot hits its mark. Gain a Free Re-roll when using, repairing, evaluating, or handling a pistol or revolver.'},
  {name:'Hacker',book:'core',books:['core','osh'],trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re a computer wizard. No firewall can stop you. Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls about computers, to hack a system, or to bypass IT security measures.'},
  {name:'Hard to Kill',book:'core',books:['core','osh'],trigger:'Passive',desc:'It doesn’t matter what they throw at you. You keep standing back up. When you fill in your Bad Box, gain 1 Adrenaline and +1 to your next roll.'},
  {name:'Head on a Swivel',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re always ready to spot what’s coming. Gain a Free Re-roll when preempting dangers or ambushes, or trying to locate lurking enemies.'},
  {name:'Heartbreaker',book:'core',books:['core','osh'],trigger:'Passive',desc:'Nobody can resist your damned smile. Gain a Free Re-roll when seducing or making a good impression on others.'},
  {name:'High Culture',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’ve studied and it shows. Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls to recall information about general culture, literature, history, and geography.'},
  {name:'Hunter',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You have predator instincts and know how to move in the wilds. Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls made to follow or hunt an animal, to find your bearings, or to hide while in the wilds.'},
  {name:'Intimidation',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re an ice-cold tough guy. You’re truly scary. Gain a Free Re-roll when intimidating or interrogating somebody.'},
  {name:'Intuition',book:'core',trigger:'Quick Action',desc:'You notice hidden details other people miss. [Quick Action] Ask the Director to give you a clue or suggestion, or find the Weak Spot of an Enemy.'},
  {name:"I'll Make a Phone Call",book:'core',trigger:'Full Turn',desc:'You have a contact, a friend, or a favor you can call in. It’s just a phone call away. [Full Turn] Call one of your contacts asking for a piece of information, a favor, a ride, or up to 3 Cash. You gain whatever you asked for during the next Time-Out.'},
  {name:'Knife Thrower',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'Knives, axes, shuriken, or playing cards — if you can hold it, you can throw it. Gain +1 when using a throwing weapon.'},
  {name:'Lie to Me',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You can understand the person in front of you at a glance. Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls made to understand somebody’s intentions or to spot lies.'},
  {name:'Lockpick',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'Doors, safes, and vaults stand no chance against your surgically precise methods. Gain a Free Re-roll when trying to pick any lock, door, or closed container.'},
  {name:'Marksman',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'There are many rifles like yours, but nobody uses a rifle like you do. Gain a Free Re-roll when using, repairing, evaluating, or handling a rifle, shotgun, sub-machine, or machine gun.'},
  {name:'Martial Arts',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You know kung fu, muay thai, boxing, or another fighting style. Gain a Free Re-roll for all Action and Reaction Rolls made when fighting unarmed.'},
  {name:'Master of Disguise',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You know how to change your appearance and hide your identity. Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls made to disguise yourself, to go unnoticed, or to take on someone else’s identity.'},
  {name:'Mastermind',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'Your brilliant ideas allow you to always come out on top. Repeat one roll of any kind. Ignore all -1s from Conditions and circumstances.'},
  {name:'Mechanic',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You grew up in a workshop and know everything about engines. Gain a Free Re-roll when building or repairing Rides and other gear.'},
  {name:'Military Background',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re a soldier. You know military hierarchy and protocol. Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls about military knowledge, for coordinating a strategy, or when recalling your training.'},
  {name:'Outsmart',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'As you always say: work smart, not hard! Make an Action or Reaction Roll of any kind using Know instead of the required Skill.'},
  {name:'Parkour',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re a free runner or an expert acrobat. You don’t go down the stairs, you jump the whole ramp. Gain a Free Re-roll when jumping, performing feats of acrobatics, or breaking a fall.'},
  {name:'Pep Talk',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'When the game gets hard, everyone gathers around you, and you always know just what to say. Gain a Free Re-roll when inspiring or coordinating others.'},
  {name:'Physician',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re a nurse, medical doctor, or paramedic. You’re certainly not squeamish about blood. Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls made to find a diagnosis, to operate on someone, or to remove physical Conditions such as the Hurt Condition.'},
  {name:'Pickpocket',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re no mere thief, you’re a theft artist. Gain a Free Re-roll when stealing something from somebody.'},
  {name:'Proven Driver',book:'core',books:['core','osh'],trigger:'Passive',desc:'Engines are your passion. You’re unrivaled at the wheel. Choose one type of ride (cars, bikes, flying, etc.). Gain a Free Re-roll when driving, repairing, or evaluating rides of your chosen type.'},
  {name:'Punch Reload',book:'core',trigger:'Quick Action',desc:'After suffering a big hit, you clench your fists and keep on fighting. [Quick Action] Once per combat, after failing a Reaction Roll against an Enemy, stand back up and immediately gain 1 Adrenaline.'},
  {name:'Reporter',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re always on the hunt for truth. Your pen is mightier than a gun. Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls made to interview people, gain information, and find contacts.'},
  {name:'Scientist',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'It could work! And you know exactly how. Choose a STEM discipline (engineering, chemistry, botany, etc.). Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls regarding your chosen discipline.'},
  {name:'Selfless',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You always defend other people with your life. You’re a true hero! Gain a Free Re-roll when defending or saving others, or when acting selflessly.'},
  {name:'Shadow',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'Nobody can catch you. You’re quick and quiet as a shadow. Gain a Free Re-roll when hiding, sneaking, or tailing someone.'},
  {name:'Silver Tongue',book:'core',books:['core','osh'],trigger:'Passive',desc:'Your words speak louder than actions, and you certainly know how to talk your way out of trouble. Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls made to lie, to persuade others, to find a compromise, or to bargain.'},
  {name:'Spinout',book:'core',trigger:'Full Turn',desc:'You pull the brake and quickly turn the wheel. Everyone better hold on tight. [Full Turn] All Heroes on the ride you are driving skip their Reaction Turn during a Chase. Flip a coin — Heads: -1 Speed; Tails: +1 Speed.'},
  {name:"That's All?",book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You are hard to persuade and even harder to impress. Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls made to show courage, to withstand pain, and to resist threats or interrogations.'},
  {name:'Too Young to Die',book:'core',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You’re young and carefree. You feel like nothing can stop you. When filling in the Bad Box, you suffer no Condition. You can only gain this Feat when creating a Young Hero.'},
  // WoK Feats
  {name:'Ambush',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'When they notice you, it’s already too late. Gain a Free Re-roll for all Action Rolls made to attack unaware targets with melee weapons or bare hands.'},
  {name:'Attack Dog',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'Your dog never barks, they only bite. When fighting side by side with your Trained Dog, gain a Free Re-roll for all Action and Reaction Rolls made to fight Enemies in Melee or Close Range.'},
  {name:'Bad Name',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'Your reputation precedes you. Immediately gain a Reputation, 1 Gold, 1$, and 1 Spotlight.',creationEffects:{goldBonus:1,cashBonus:1,spotlightBonus:1}},
  {name:'Beware of the Owner',book:'wok',trigger:'Quick Action',desc:'They can do anything to you, but they better not touch your dog. [Quick Action] Once per combat or scene, after your Trained Dog has lost 1 Grit, immediately gain 1 Adrenaline.'},
  {name:'Catch!',book:'wok',trigger:'Quick Action',desc:'You flick your hand, and your dog leaps to attack. [Quick Action] Your Trained Dog bites a target within Close Range — the target loses 1 Grit, or you gain +1 Speed during a chase on foot.'},
  {name:'Deflect Bullets',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You are so fast that you can cut bullets in half mid-flight. Requires the Sword Fighter Feat. Using your sword, deflect a hail of bullets without rolling. Flip a coin — Heads: you ricochet one bullet back to the shooter and the Enemy loses 1 Grit.'},
  {name:'Determination',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'Your inner strength cannot be shaken. Make a Reaction Roll of any kind using Endure +1 instead of the required Skill.'},
  {name:'Elegance',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'When you walk by, everyone stops to look. Such class! Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls involving high society, showing off your refined manners, or recalling the rules of etiquette.'},
  {name:'Endure Pain',book:'wok',trigger:'Quick Action',desc:'No pain! Remove one Condition from yourself. You cannot remove the Broken Condition this way.'},
  {name:'Expedient',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You always know how to get by. Make an Action or Reaction Roll of any kind using Streetwise instead of the required Skill.'},
  {name:'Feint',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You fight using your head, not just your hands. Repeat an Action Roll against an Enemy and ignore all Conditions.'},
  {name:'Gun Fu',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'Your unique fighting style is a mixture of point-blank gunshots and martial arts. When fighting with a loaded pistol or revolver, gain a Free Re-roll for all Action and Reaction Rolls made to fight Enemies in Melee or Close Range.'},
  {name:'Leap',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You somehow always manage to land on a soft surface. Jump from any height and land without consequences. Additionally, when you jump onto your Enemies to attack them from up high, you always gain +1.'},
  {name:'Live and Learn',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You know how to learn from mistakes — especially other people’s. After another Hero has failed a roll, automatically succeed in the same roll without rolling the dice.'},
  {name:'Pass the Buck',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'To err is human, but only suckers pay their own consequences. A friend suffers the consequences of a failure instead of you.'},
  {name:'Rescue',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'Your dog always swoops in to get you out of trouble at the very last second. Your Trained Dog prevents a Hero from suffering the Broken Condition, or saves a Hero who lost their spin on the Death Roulette. The rescued Hero adds a Lethal Bullet to their roulette as usual.'},
  {name:'Savoir Faire',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'You can get through all hardships with grace and good manners. Make an Action or Reaction Roll of any kind using Style instead of the required Skill.'},
  {name:'Sniffer',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',adr:true,desc:'Nothing can escape the hyper-trained nose of your dog. Gain a Free Re-roll for all rolls made to follow a trail or locate an enemy ambush while you’re with your Trained Dog. [Quick Action] You may spend 1 Adrenaline to find an Enemy’s Weak Spot.'},
  {name:'Sword Fighter',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'In a world filled with guns, you decided to be the guy with a sword. Gain a Free Re-roll when using, repairing, evaluating, or handling a sword or another melee weapon.'},
  {name:'Vanish',book:'wok',trigger:'Quick Action',adr:true,desc:'Now they see you. Now they don’t. [Quick Action] Get out of a dangerous or uncomfortable situation, or abandon a chase or combat without needing to roll the dice. You may spend 1 additional Adrenaline to reappear in another position within Medium Range.'},
  {name:'Whirlwind',book:'wok',trigger:'Passive',desc:'When the going gets tough, the tough start spinning their blades. Requires the Sword Fighter Feat. After striking an Enemy with a melee weapon, make a second Action Roll at -1. You do not have a Free Re-roll for this roll.'},
  ...FEATS_OSH
];

